  "stem": "For the linear function \\(f\\), \\(f(3) + f(7) = 40\\) and \\(f(7) - f(3) = 12\\). What is the value of \\(f(10)\\)?",
  "figure": null,
  "answer_type": "spr",
  "choices": null,
  "answer": null,
  "spr_answers": [
    "35"
  ],
  "solution": [
    "Adding the equations: \\(2f(7) = 52\\), so \\(f(7) = 26\\) and \\(f(3) = 14\\).",
    "Slope \\(= \\frac{26 - 14}{7 - 3} = 3\\).",
    "\\(f(10) = f(7) + 3 \\cdot 3 = 35\\)."
  ],
  "explanation": null,
  "traps": null,
  "verify": "x, a, b = symbols('x a b')\nf = a*x + b\ns = solve([Eq(f.subs(x, 3) + f.subs(x, 7), 40), Eq(f.subs(x, 7) - f.subs(x, 3), 12)], [a, b], dict=True)\nv = f.subs(s[0]).subs(x, 10)\nassert len(s) == 1 and v == 35\nassert [Rational(t) for t in spr_answers] == [v]",
